00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:37.530
March, 1585 - Settsu Province, Ibaraki Castle

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.000
I must remain calm.

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:05.320
Hashiba-sama has allowed me to hold a tea ceremony.

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:06.930
It has been three months already.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.730
I must remain calm...

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:13.550
I must, so I can show what has been displayed on that wall painting.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:21.080
(Simplicity)

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:24.150
Changing Man

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:32.120
Master finally came to the Simplicity Room that I have created.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:41.810
At 41 years of age, I have finally become a man of tea.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:04.040
The temperature is approriate, and the taste is good.

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:11.570
Now, for the Hatsuhana.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:15.260
This is one of the triumverate that I have borrowed from Hashiba-sama.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.250
Please keep its use here a secret.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.370
I understand.

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:24.670
I finally understand the reason for all of the security outside.

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:28.310
Hatsuhana paired with a Shitoku tea spoon.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:33.170
Mino's Imayaki tea cup paired with some sort of covering?

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:37.150
Those are pieces of Matsunaga's Hiragumo.

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:41.840
The steam leaking from the holes in the cover provide an interesting view.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.940
You have paired famed goods with those not named as famed.

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:49.720
Thus highlighting the theme of simplicity.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.770
As expected of Furuta-sama.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.800
I have learned much from you, Master.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:56.410
But...

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:00.290
Simplicity Room is not an appropriate name.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:05.180
You are simply copying my Taian.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:14.010
From the path outside leading to the placement of the windows,

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.120
I do not feel any sense of work.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:20.920
I am fine with you trying to imitate imperfection,

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:25.060
but simple plagiarism leads to the opinion of fakery.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.240
I may be an outsider,

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:33.100
but as a warrior, might your criticism be too scathing?

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:36.800
No.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:42.450
Furuta-sama is about to become a man of status.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:48.030
I believe he will one day show me the fruits of his own creativity.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.930
So you know already...

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.970
Hashiba-sama became the chief advisor to the emperor,

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.970
and I attained an official rank.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.850
I have been teaching Tokugawa-sama's right hand man,

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:04.670
Ishikawa Kazumasa-sama, in the differentiation of tea provisions.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:09.470
I have heard of many people wanting Master's services,

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.660
but I never thought Master would choose Tokugawa.

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:21.930
A letter arrived a few days ago in which Tokugawa-sama praised Furuta-sama.

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:27.810
You have done so much,

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:31.160
so it is only natural for you to attain rank.

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:36.920
I look forward to your work.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:40.990
You have strived to take one more step into the world of imperfection.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:48.270
With my rank...

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:58.240
...my salary will increase.

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.690
My responsibilities will increase, too.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:04.350
I will have to devote some of my energy to the warrior spirit.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.950
It will be hard for me to move on further into the world of imperfection.

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:14.660
July, 1585 - Settsu Province, Oozaka Castle

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:37.340
Every time I pass by here,

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:41.780
I think about how Nobunaga-sama built this, and not Hideyoshi-sama.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:43.970
But look at all this...

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:49.370
Three floors of stone with seven floors above and two floors below.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.160
Gold adorned everywhere,

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:55.040
molded into tigers and herons.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:58.440
This splendor lies far and beyond Azuchi Castle.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:08.160
Oozaka Castle, the greatest in the world, co-exists now with the tiny Taian...

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:13.140
What an era I am living in.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:24.080
I have heard that Master took part in building this.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.650
Where does the simplicity lie?

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:46.460
It is truly a day to celebrate, with you becoming the emperor's chief advisor.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.880
Fujiwara Hideyoshi-sama.

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:51.010
Raise your head.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:04.050
How do I look? More manly?

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:08.560
I am sure the ladies will love this.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.400
Excuse me.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:13.300
Will I be able to court Ochacha?

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:16.350
She has gotten much more feminine lately.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.740
I finally became one with the Heavens.

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:36.110
Ieyasu will not follow me that easily, though.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:38.670
Not Hashiba's era just yet, it seems.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:43.580
Now the emperor is behind my back, I am sure no one can go up against me.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:47.530
You have worked hard, Sasuke.

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.240
Let me make you a daimyo.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:09:01.450
I shall directly rule after Settsu. Nakagawa and Takayama will move into Harima.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:05.440
You will be relieved of your duties as Nakagawa's guardian.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:10.110
As exchange, you will receive the hills west of Yamashiro Province and 35,000 koku.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:13.560
35,000 koku can carry you far in Kyoto.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:14.690
No objections, right?

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:21.390
I am shivering with delight.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.790
So regarding your title...

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:28.700
Just choose one.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:30.590
It holds no meaning anyway.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:35.140
Here are all sorts of titles.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:43.320
Even if it is just a name,

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:47.080
I may go to the grave with it.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:50.120
Sasuke is such a poor sounding name.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.460
It does not sit well with anyone.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:56.310
I need to choose a strict name, fitting of a warrior.

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:59.940
But if I choose a name higher than my title,

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.890
I will feel embarrassment unbefitting of myself.

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:06.480
It is for the best to choose a name that will demonstrate my warrior spirit.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:09.850
Let me see... Furuta Ookura.

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:12.830
Furuta Danjou sounds strong, too.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:17.740
Those do sound impactful.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.710
This naming business...

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.840
It is more intense than my duties as a warrior.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:27.030
I have to choose an elegant name that fits me.

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:42.370
This is a nice color.

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:46.290
I hear they call this color olive in Nanban.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.560
What a fresh color...

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.770
Olive.

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.490
Let me interject.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:08.290
I wish to have a name implicating the duties of both a weaver and a painter, Oribe.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.990
That name sounds much more common than Danjou or Ookura.

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:14.860
Have your ambitions weaned?

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:20.820
No! My body fills with vigor of other ambitions.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:32.470
All right then. In the place of the Emperor, Furuta Sasuke,

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:42.200
shall now be known as the Junior Fifth Rank Furuta Oribe!

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:49.880
Latter half of July, Yamashiro Province, West Hills 

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:57.370
My eldest daughter, Sen.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:58.330
Here.

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:01.160
My brother-in-law, Furuta Shigetsugu.

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:02.040
Here.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:05.450
There is only one reason I had you two wed.

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:10.970
I want you two to take over the house of my late brother, Nakagawa.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:14.870
Hidemasa-dono has been promoted and moved to Harima.

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:19.110
13,000 koku worth of land is not easy to govern.

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:20.770
Work hard!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:27.130
I am eternally grateful, Furuta Oribe-no-kamisama.

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:33.550
Furuta Oribe-no-kami.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.720
That sounds brilliant.

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:39.270
Not too strict, not too soft.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:41.950
It brings up associations with the fresh plains.

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:43.730
It is the best name ever.

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:48.640
As Oribe's father, let me give you a suggestion.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.190
Do not become someone like him!

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.350
If you become like him, obsessed with the material goods,

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:59.190
your lineage will end right then and there.

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:01.240
You must attend to the master of the house,

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:04.260
and think of the future of the Furuta name.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.440
What are you saying, Father?

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.090
When was I obsessed...

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.500
Still putting up a front?

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:16.240
Did you not send money to Mino's ceramic master?

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:22.830
I apologize profusely, Father.

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:26.320
I have not been a good wife and have caused you worry.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:29.170
Osen, no need for you to apologize.

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:33.980
You are the reason my foolish son has not gone astray yet.

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:36.880
Well then.

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:40.520
I should get to work, since it seems like I do not belong here.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:41.690
Osen.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:44.660
I will be gone for five days. Take care of things here.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:45.870
Huh?

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:48.930
Wait.

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:54.190
Where are you going?

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:05.760
I am going to see Mino's ceramic master. I have business.

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:09.200
You failure of a son!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.970
What bad timing.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:22.250
Are you heading out, Oribe-dono?

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.410
Who are you again?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:28.190
I am Ueda Sataro Shigeyasu.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:31.260
When my lord Niwa Nagahide-sama passed away,

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.790
I have been ordered by the Chief Advisor to come by and say hello.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.950
Thank you for your kindness.

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:40.760
I have long wanted to see you.

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:51.800
I was utterly shocked by that flamboyant Nobu banner.

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:58.120
I could not focus on the fight at hand.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:03.380
You should have some free time, am I right?

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:06.760
If you can accompany me to Mino,

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:08.990
I can show you something even better.

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:16.020
He is...

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.740
Furuta Sasuke!

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:32.190
He may be a bit strange...

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:35.320
I only wanted to greet him.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.500
But I want to accompany him.

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:43.070
Who are you, Furuta Oribe?

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.750
Mino Province, Kujiri

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:53.830
That is quite a bit of rice...

00:15:54.590 --> 00:16:00.050
I want you, Kato Kagenobu the ceramic master, to focus entirely on your work.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:03.190
How can I accept this much?

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.790
That is correct, Oribe-dono.

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:10.250
This rice is the sweat and blood of the people.

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:14.380
You should be working for the people of the West Hills.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:18.130
My people are quite generous and they aim high.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:22.840
They have no complaints if it is for the greater good.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.560
Have your kiln artisans gotten here yet?

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:32.580
From Kani to Seto,

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:36.660
I have gathered all of the kiln artisans that you deemed worthy.

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:38.000
Thank you very much.

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:50.230
Let us go, Ueda-dono.

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.970
I have brought you the Imayaki you ordered.

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:19.450
The Seto black tea cup.

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:22.320
I have been waiting for this!

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:27.380
Chojirou, the Master's right hand, had created this masterful piece of work!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.060
I do not know if it will please you.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:51.140
Yes! The very essence of simplicity! Yes!

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:54.140
Good job, Hanzou.

00:17:54.390 --> 00:18:00.480
Chojirou-dono has many great works fitting of black.

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:02.740
I changed my instructions this time.

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:06.630
I had him create a tea cup that is smooth and tough so the tea is not too hot during summer.

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:09.000
That is great!

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:12.010
If I had tried another imitation, Master would scold me again.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:15.180
I want to show Master this right now and see what he thinks.

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:22.300
How is it?

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:32.710
I do not feel the same intensity as the Nobu banner.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.850
Your sense of imperfection is still young.

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:38.070
Hanshichi from Muta no Boraga!

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.030
Here!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:47.130
You are well versed in the Shino-yaki. Take a look at this.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:55.810
What is this red drawing in the middle?

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:58.280
Nipples.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:00.250
Nipples?

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.110
Do not prod me further.

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:05.780
I do not want to explore in detail the intricacies of my wife's physical body.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:14.440
To dye a color is something very difficult.

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.780
But we have accepted so much from you.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:20.700
I shall do my best to create your idea!

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:28.420
You must create something worthy of striking me into the heavens.

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:45.400
Ganzou!

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:46.650
Here!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.390
Here is your mark!

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.210
What is that mark?

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:58.190
Jouhachi!

00:19:58.310 --> 00:19:58.930
Yes!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:00.480
Sasuke!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:01.250
Yes!

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:02.610
Tomojuu!

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:03.330
Yes!

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:04.580
Rokube!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:05.290
Yes!

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:06.880
Hanshichi!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:07.540
Yes!

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:08.930
Jihei!

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:09.550
Yes!

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:10.990
Konkuro!

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:11.660
Yes!

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.190
Hachirouji!

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:13.760
Yes!

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:15.540
Kichiemon!

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:16.590
Yes!

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:21.100
Kagenobu-dono, you will oversee everyone here.

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:24.280
I want all of you to create new tea cups to the best of your abilities.

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:31.950
All of you should know that the late Nobunaga commissioned the Six Works of Seto.

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:36.910
He gave each of his artisans different marks and advanced the art of Imayaki.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:39.850
But ever since he passed,

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.760
there have been no successors.

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:47.610
That is the shame of the heavens.

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:50.070
What a great tragedy!

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:57.320
Is it truly something that serious?

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:01.330
Do not worry.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:11.240
I have attained a rank of 35,000 koku.

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.870
I will succeed the late Nobunaga.

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:17.820
I shall commission the Ten Works of Oribe!

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:20.390
Mino ceramics shall shake the heavens!

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:26.950
The Ten Works of Oribe?

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:35.100
Oribe-sama! Oribe-sama! Oribe-sama!

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:36.780
The Ten Works of Oribe?

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:40.080
Did he get permission from the Chief Advisor?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.500
Something that strikes me to the heavens...

00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:18.690
I...

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:24.230
I have never seen such a ridiculous leader!

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:27.210
I can see it.

00:22:27.580 --> 00:22:29.210
Even I can see it.

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:35.610
Is he crazy? Or is he someone with a personality that strikes fear into my heart!?

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:46.200
I should observe him for now.

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:56.860
Furuta Oribe you crazed man. Let me shiver from the bottom of my heart, 

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:06.510
Everytime I　

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:06.510
Anata no mune

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:08.900
feel your heart

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:08.900
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:14.990
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:14.990
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:21.170
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:21.170
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:27.330
Opppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:27.330
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:33.420
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:33.420
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:37.300
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:37.300
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:40.880
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:40.880
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:46.750
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:46.750
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.850 --> 00:23:49.750
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.850 --> 00:23:49.750
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:52.360
Without each other.

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:52.360
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:53.320
You should

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:53.320
Soshite

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:58.820
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:58.820
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:02.610
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:02.610
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:08.320
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:08.320
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:14.810
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:14.810
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.870 --> 00:24:20.610
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.870 --> 00:24:20.610
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:26.590
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:22.090 --> 00:24:26.590
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.950 --> 00:24:36.580
Right?

00:24:41.910 --> 00:24:43.380
Come on.

00:24:48.230 --> 00:24:49.850
Die!

00:24:49.850 --> 00:24:52.970
The one and only flower in the world.

00:24:53.530 --> 00:24:58.260
To be a warrior or an aestete? That is the question.

00:24:56.430 --> 00:24:59.850
The One and Only Flower In the World
